From f4fa836b143d3dd7bcbc872fad323e81fe8a4a25 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dmitry Belyavskiy <beldmit@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 4 Jun 2026 17:36:31 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 54/55] Implement ML-DSA signature algorithms per
 draft-sfluhrer-ssh-mldsa-06

Add ssh-mldsa-44, ssh-mldsa-65, and ssh-mldsa-87 public key algorithms
using FIPS 204 (ML-DSA) via OpenSSL 3.5+ EVP API. Includes certificate
variants and FIPS mode support.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>
